ment of Health and the Wellcome Trust. GLS is a Wellcome Principal Research Fellow; JMG is supported by the Royal Society; DIS is supported by the UK Medical Research Council. ELW is supported by the Wellcome Trust Project Grant 076036/Z/04/Z. This work was enabled by European Commission contract numbers QLG2-CT-2002&#x02013;00988 (SPINE) and LSHG-CT-2006&#x02013;031220 (SPINE2-Complexes).</p></fn><fn id="ack3" fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing interests.</bold> The authors have declared that no competing interests exist.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>